549    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
550    -- The composition guard assertions (spec-patch-07 section 5.2), proven directly against the
551    -- real tables, bypassing road_admin_api entirely -- the point of an assertion over a package
552    -- check is that it holds when the package does not run. Every insert here targets a
553    -- (role, permission) pair not already in road_role_permissions, and every branch rolls back, so
554    -- these leave no state behind for teardown to clean up.
555    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
556  
557    procedure test_assertion_permits_ordinary_session_attach is
558      l_sys number := principal_of('SYSADM');
