=== the fix: grant_all_app_permissions must skip a reserved permission ===
SQL> 
SQL> -- road-kit has no unreserved application permission to grant, so this probe asserts the negative
SQL> -- directly: a blanket grant to road.user_admin must not pick up any of the five reserved
SQL> -- framework permissions. Before the fix the road. prefix filter alone would also have excluded
SQL> -- them -- the case that separates the two rules needs an application permission, which is why
SQL> -- the real regression test waits for the demo app (spec-patch-08 section 8).
SQL> declare
  2    l_before number;
  3    l_after  number;
  4  begin
  5    select count(*) into l_before from road_role_permissions where role_name = 'road.user_admin';
  6    road_admin_api.grant_all_app_permissions('road.user_admin');
